  "identifier": "psychstrata-dashboard",
  "name": "PsychStrata Dashboard",
  "description": "Interactive dashboard for shared decision-making on treatment resistance in major depressive disorder (MDD). Presents prediction, explainability (feature attribution), and patient stratification (t-SNE) to support clinician–patient discussion of treatment options. Python backend + TypeScript/Vite frontend, Docker Compose, with a live synthetic-data demo. From Fraunhofer SCAI (the PsychStrata EU project). A research prototype on synthetic data — explicitly not a medical device and not for clinical use.",
  "url": "https://demo.psychstrata.bio.scai.fraunhofer.de/",
